{"unit_id":"DONGBIN007__dsh-sidebar-restart#feature-1","repo":"DONGBIN007/dsh-sidebar-restart","commit":"1867e6df330363e3d6f92db954d3038336ba45c8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-restart 的功能「重启桌面应用」：用户点击侧栏按钮并确认后，客户端向主机发送重启请求；辅助进程重新启动应用，页面检测到新进程后自动刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:440-494","index.js:82-123","lib/helper.js:123-138"]}
